{"blocks": [{"bbox": [0.0, 0.0, 596.0, 842.0], "text": "", "type": "Page"}, {"bbox": [56.45703125, 53.447265625, 539.9274291992188, 61.6982421875], "text": "microfocus.com/valueedge 5", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [56.748046875, 99.3912353515625, 344.35614013671875, 135.3912353515625], "text": "Meet ValueEdge TM", "type": "SectionHeader"}, {"bbox": [55.875, 217.078125, 509.3953857421875, 327.06085205078125], "text": "ValueEdge delivers end-to-end value stream management capabilities. It provides a unified, flexible way to visualize, track, and manage flow and value throughout development. This cloud-based DevOps and VSM platform works with your development tools to improve production efficiency, maximize quality delivery, and align business goals with development resources.", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [76.24609375, 357.685546875, 212.37469482421875, 369.3384704589844], "text": "With ValueEdge, you get:", "type": "SectionHeader"}, {"bbox": [74.791015625, 391.8095703125, 327.893310546875, 633.1723937988281], "text": "", "type": "ListGroup"}, {"bbox": [74.791015625, 391.8095703125, 289.1316223144531, 407.4644775390625], "text": "AI-powered predictive intelligence.", "type": "ListItem"}, {"bbox": [75.373046875, 432.9228515625, 327.893310546875, 450.6064758300781], "text": "Seamless integration with your toolchains.", "type": "ListItem"}, {"bbox": [75.6640625, 475.26953125, 307.4839172363281, 492.724365234375], "text": "Real-time pipeline visibility and status.", "type": "ListItem"}, {"bbox": [75.955078125, 518.4384765625, 297.10870361328125, 536.724365234375], "text": "Persona-based actionable analytics.", "type": "ListItem"}, {"bbox": [76.24609375, 562.4296875, 306.7193908691406, 581.9453735351562], "text": "Smart automation of critical functions.", "type": "ListItem"}, {"bbox": [75.373046875, 604.365234375, 289.410888671875, 633.1723937988281], "text": "A unified strategy, development, testing, and deployment approach.", "type": "ListItem"}, {"bbox": [333.794921875, 374.7082824707031, 536.5140380859375, 434.9662780761719], "text": "In short, these features give you the power to deliver maximum value. And the more value you bring customers, the happier they are. Happy customers breed more customers, which keeps you ahead of the competition.", "type": "Text"}], "doc_id": "transform-software-delivery-with-valueedge-brochure.pdf", "page_index": 6, "pdf_path": "/mmfs1/data/group/ems036/lxu/mpvrdu/.data/mmlongbench/documents/transform-software-delivery-with-valueedge-brochure.pdf", "source": "marker"}